  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Migrant Communities with Access to Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education sector in Libya has been severely impacted during the crisis and armed conflict. Migrant children struggle the most in accessing education in Libya. The overall objective of this project is to contribute to ensuring that school-aged boys and girls in Libya have uninterrupted access to quality, safe and protective learning that supports their mental and physical wellbeing and improves learning outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
